  "id": "verbal-narrative",
  "term": "verbal narrative",
  "definition": "Verbal narrative is a story conveyed through language, such as by reading or hearing it, rather than through moving images. In the source, it is described as engaging verbal processing and often also mental imagery and personal memory.",
